            "type": "part",
            "label": "a",
            "prompt": "$A'$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{1,5,6\\}$",
              "worked": "The elements of $\\Omega$ outside $A$ are $1,5,6$.\n$$A'=\\{1,5,6\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 12
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q1-b",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "b",
            "prompt": "$B'$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{1,2,6\\}$",
              "worked": "The elements of $\\Omega$ outside $B$ are $1,2,6$.\n$$B'=\\{1,2,6\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 12
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q1-c",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "c",
            "prompt": "$A\\cap B$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{3,4\\}$",
              "worked": "The elements common to $A$ and $B$ are $3$ and $4$.\n$$A\\cap B=\\{3,4\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 12
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q1-d",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "d",
            "prompt": "$A\\cup B$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{2,3,4,5\\}$",
              "worked": "Include every element in $A$ or $B$, listing common elements once.\n$$A\\cup B=\\{2,3,4,5\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 12
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q1-e",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "e",
            "prompt": "$A\\cap B'$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{2\\}$",
              "worked": "$B'=\\{1,2,6\\}$. The only element also in $A$ is $2$.\n$$A\\cap B'=\\{2\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 16
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q1-f",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "f",
            "prompt": "$B\\cap A'$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{5\\}$",
              "worked": "$A'=\\{1,5,6\\}$. The only element also in $B$ is $5$.\n$$B\\cap A'=\\{5\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 16
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q1-g",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "g",
            "prompt": "$A\\cup B'$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{1,2,3,4,6\\}$",
              "worked": "$B'=\\{1,2,6\\}$. Include every element in $A$ or $B'$.\n$$A\\cup B'=\\{1,2,3,4,6\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q1-h",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "h",
            "prompt": "$B\\cup A'$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{1,3,4,5,6\\}$",
              "worked": "$A'=\\{1,5,6\\}$. Include every element in $B$ or $A'$.\n$$B\\cup A'=\\{1,3,4,5,6\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q1-i",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "i",
            "prompt": "$(A\\cap B)'$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{1,2,5,6\\}$",
              "worked": "$A\\cap B=\\{3,4\\}$. Take the elements of $\\Omega$ outside this intersection.\n$$(A\\cap B)'=\\{1,2,5,6\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q1-j",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "j",
            "prompt": "$A'\\cup B'$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{1,2,5,6\\}$",
              "worked": "$A'=\\{1,5,6\\}$ and $B'=\\{1,2,6\\}$. Combine their elements without repetition.\n$$A'\\cup B'=\\{1,2,5,6\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 22
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q1-k",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "k",
            "prompt": "$(A\\cup B)'$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{1,6\\}$",
              "worked": "$A\\cup B=\\{2,3,4,5\\}$. Take the elements of $\\Omega$ outside this union.\n$$(A\\cup B)'=\\{1,6\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q1-l",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "l",
            "prompt": "$A'\\cap B'$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\{1,6\\}$",
              "worked": "$A'=\\{1,5,6\\}$ and $B'=\\{1,2,6\\}$. Their common elements are $1$ and $6$.\n$$A'\\cap B'=\\{1,6\\}.$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 22
          }
        ]
      }
